{"seq":1,"slug":"master-child-package","title":"母包子包裹映射追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/consolidation-tracking/master-child-package","wordCount":2496,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"母包子包裹映射追踪\">母包子包裹映射追踪</h1><p>合单之后，物流对象的数量关系从「一件货一个运单号」变成一棵树：一个母包承运整批货，母包里装着属于不同订单的子包。买家关心的是「我这一件到哪了」，承运商只认母包的运单号，仓库需要知道母包里此刻有什么，客服需要回答「为什么我的包裹里有两件别人的货」。<strong>这一篇定义承载这些问题的数据结构：母包与子包的映射。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个实体，一个关系。</p>\n<p><strong>子包（child package）</strong>：一件货的最小可追踪单元，其粒度是「一个订单里的一个订单行」。子包携带归属订单、归属买家、归属卖家、申报价值、实际重量体积、责任主体。子包是<strong>逻辑实体</strong>，它有自己的标识，但通常没有独立的承运商运单号。</p>\n<p><strong>母包（master package）</strong>：一个承运容器，是承运商实际接收、运输、清关、派送的对象。它有独立的运单号（tracking number）、面单、申报清单。母包由一次合包作业生成。</p>\n<p><strong>持有关系（containment）</strong>：母包持有子包的集合。它是<strong>带时间维度的关系</strong>，不是外键。</p>\n<p>第三点是最容易做错的地方。把持有关系实现成 <code>child.master_id</code> 这样的字段，会在第一次拆单或再合包时崩溃——因为一个子包在一生中可能属于多个母包：被合进母包 A，因拆单取出，又合进母包 B。字段只能表达「当前属于谁」，只能表达「何时属于谁」。正确做法是把持有关系建成<strong>带上界与下界的时序关系</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>containment</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{containment} = (master\\_id,\\ child\\_id,\\ t_{bound}, t_{unbound})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">containment</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{unbound}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为空表示当前仍被持有。任何时刻的母子关系由时间区间查询得到，而不是由当前字段值得到。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[合包作业完成] --&gt; B[创建母包 M1 获取运单号]&#10;    B --&gt; C[为每个入库件创建或确认子包 C1..Cn]&#10;    C --&gt; D[建立持有关系 M1-Ci 记 t_bound]&#10;    D --&gt; E[母包运输 事件挂到 M1 运单]&#10;    E --&gt; F{是否发生拆单}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[终点派送 全部子包 t_unbound]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[取出 Ck 记 t_unbound]&#10;    H --&gt; I[新建母包 M2 或独立运单]&#10;    I --&gt; J[建立新持有关系 M2-Ck]&#10;    E --&gt; K[追踪查询: 按子包反查当前母包]&#10;    K --&gt; L[返回 M 的运单轨迹 + 子包自身归属]\">graph TD\n    A[合包作业完成] --&gt; B[创建母包 M1 获取运单号]\n    B --&gt; C[为每个入库件创建或确认子包 C1..Cn]\n    C --&gt; D[建立持有关系 M1-Ci 记 t_bound]\n    D --&gt; E[母包运输 事件挂到 M1 运单]\n    E --&gt; F{是否发生拆单}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[终点派送 全部子包 t_unbound]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[取出 Ck 记 t_unbound]\n    H --&gt; I[新建母包 M2 或独立运单]\n    I --&gt; J[建立新持有关系 M2-Ck]\n    E --&gt; K[追踪查询: 按子包反查当前母包]\n    K --&gt; L[返回 M 的运单轨迹 + 子包自身归属]</pre><h2 id=\"追踪事件的上卷与下发\">追踪事件的上卷与下发</h2><p>承运商回传的轨迹事件是<strong>母包级</strong>的，而买家关心的是<strong>子包级</strong>的。两者之间需要双向映射。</p>\n<p><strong>上卷（roll-up）</strong>：把子包级的事件合成母包级的当前状态。子包的物理移动造成母包的移动，因此母包状态是子包状态的某种聚合。但注意聚合函数是 <code>min</code> 还是 <code>max</code> 取决于语义：母包「全部到齐」是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span>（所有子包都到），母包「已出发」是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span>（任一子包已出发则母包在动）。这一区分在处理部分到货时很关键。</p>\n<p><strong>下发（drill-down）</strong>：把母包的事件分发到子包，使买家能查到自己的货。下发不是简单复制——同一个母包事件对不同子包的含义可能不同。例如「母包已清关」对母包内所有子包都成立；但「母包派送失败」可能只影响其中一部分（若承运商支持部分派送）。</p>\n<p>下发必须<strong>幂等</strong>：同一母包事件重复回传（承运商接口重试是常态）不能产生重复的子包事件。幂等键应当是 <code>(承运商, 母包运单号, 事件的原始唯一标识)</code>，而不是时间戳——时间戳在重传时可能变化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>母包事件</th>\n<th>上卷语义</th>\n<th>下发到子包</th>\n<th>幂等要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已收件</td>\n<td>任一子包已交承运</td>\n<td>全部子包标记已发出</td>\n<td>按事件原始 ID 去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线运输中</td>\n<td>全部子包在途</td>\n<td>全部子包标记在途</td>\n<td>同一状态重复回传忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关中/已清关</td>\n<td>全部子包对应</td>\n<td>全部子包同步</td>\n<td>清关状态可能回退，需允许</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送失败</td>\n<td>部分/全部受影响</td>\n<td>按承运商提供的子包明细分发</td>\n<td>无明细时不臆断，标记待确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已签收</td>\n<td>全部子包签收</td>\n<td>全部子包标记签收</td>\n<td>签收人与收货凭证需存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「清关状态可能回退」值得单独一提：清关是少数会出现状态<strong>倒退</strong>的环节（已放行后可能被重新查验）。多数状态机假设单调前进，直接套用会在清关环节产生状态混乱。清关段需要允许有限的状态回退，这属于 <a href=\"consolidation-status\">集运各阶段状态（集货/合包/发出）</a> 讨论的归一化问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件时间与观测时间的分离\">事件时间与观测时间的分离</h3><p>下发与上卷过程中有一对容易被混淆的时间戳：<strong>事件发生时间</strong>（承运商扫描的时刻）与<strong>系统观测时间</strong>（事件到达系统的时刻）。两者可能相差数小时甚至数天，尤其在跨境段（承运商数据通过第三方聚合商转手时延迟更明显）。</p>\n<p>所有面向买家的时间展示应当使用事件发生时间，因为那是货的真实位置对应的时刻；但所有<strong>超时判定与告警</strong>应当使用观测时间，因为系统只能在观测到之后才可能行动。若把两者混用，会出现「系统在货早已到达之后才判定超时」这种自相矛盾的告警。</p>\n<p>一个实用的做法是在事件记录里同时保留两个时间戳，并在下游显式声明用哪一个：追踪展示用事件时间，SLA 计算与告警用观测时间，两者不可互换。这也是排查「状态看起来晚了一天才更新」这类工单时首先要问的问题——晚的究竟是货，还是数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆单与再合包-映射的时间语义\">拆单与再合包：映射的时间语义</h2><p>持有关系的时间维度在以下四种场景中真正发挥作用。</p>\n<p><strong>场景一：拆单。</strong> 取出子包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(M_1, C_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{unbound}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设为当前时刻，并为其创建新的持有关系或独立运单。此时查询「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当前属于谁」得到新母包，查询「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 曾经属于谁」得到完整历史。历史很重要：已经产生的母包事件（在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被取出之前发生的）仍然算作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的轨迹，不能因为换了母包就丢掉。</p>\n<p><strong>场景二：再合包。</strong> 在集运仓，一个子包可能先合入一个临时集包（例如同卖家批量的整批运输），到达集运仓后拆出，再与其他卖家的货合入最终母包。这是典型的「两次合包」。用时间区间表示很简单：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(M_{batch}, C_k, t_1, t_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>null</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(M_{final}, C_k, t_2, \\text{null})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">null</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 两条记录。用字段表示则两次合包中必有一次丢失信息。</p>\n<p><strong>场景三：追溯某个时刻的整包内容。</strong> 合规或理赔场景下常被问到：「母包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在清关时刻装的是什么？」回答这个问题需要按 <code>t_bound &lt;= 清关时刻 &lt; t_unbound</code> 查询。这正是时间区间表示法的核心价值——它能回答<strong>任意历史时刻</strong>的问题，而字段法只能回答「现在」。</p>\n<p><strong>场景四：多对多的一次性表达。</strong> 一个母包可能被拆成多个母包（一次拆出三件分别走三条路），也可能由多个母包拼成一个（合并运输）。时间区间模型天然支持多对多，因为它就是一个带时间的关系表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"映射的可观测性与数据质量\">映射的可观测性与数据质量</h2><p>这套结构的正确性靠三类检查维持。</p>\n<p><strong>完整性检查</strong>：任何一个子包在任意时刻应当最多属于一个母包（未被持有时属于 0 个）。查询 <code>count(*) where child = Ck and t_unbound is null</code> 必须 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。违反这个不变式意味着某次拆单或合包操作没有成对地写上下界——这是最常见的数据缺陷，应在写入时用约束或事务保证，并定期扫描。</p>\n<p><strong>一致性检查</strong>：母包的事件时间序列与子包的事件时间序列不能矛盾（子包不可能在母包收件之前就离开母包）。这类检查用于发现映射被错误更新后的残留。</p>\n<p><strong>覆盖率检查</strong>：母包在承运商侧的<strong>申报清单</strong>（用于清关与理赔）与系统内的子包集合必须一致。这两份数据来自不同系统（合包作业系统与清关申报系统），不一致会在清关被查或被索赔时暴露。因此每次合包完成与每次拆单之后，都应触发一次清单与映射的比对。</p>\n<p>这三类检查共同保证一件事：<strong>包裹树的结构是可信的</strong>。前端渲染轨迹、客服回答问题、清关提交申报、理赔分摊金额，全都依赖这棵树，而它们各自关注的侧重点不同（追踪关心时序、清关关心内容、理赔关心归属与价值）。一个结构可信的映射是这四个下游能力的共同地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>追踪的最小结构是三个实体一个关系：子包（订单行粒度、逻辑实体、通常无独立运单号）、母包（承运容器、有独立运单号与面单）、持有关系。</li>\n<li>持有关系必须建成带时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(master, child, t_{bound}, t_{unbound})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的时序关系；用 <code>child.master_id</code> 字段会在拆单与再合包时丢失历史。</li>\n<li>承运商事件是母包级的，需上卷（聚合函数按语义取 min/max）与下发（幂等，按事件原始 ID 去重，不复制而按受影响子包分发）。</li>\n<li>清关是允许状态回退的少数环节，状态机不能假设单调前进。</li>\n<li>时间区间模型支持四类场景：拆单、再合包、任意历史时刻的整包内容追溯、多对多的一次性表达。</li>\n<li>用完整性（子包至多属于一个母包）、一致性（事件时序无矛盾）、覆盖率（承运商申报清单与系统子包集合一致）三类检查维持结构可信。</li>\n<li>母包状态的归一化见 <a href=\"consolidation-status\">集运各阶段状态（集货/合包/发出）</a>；申报清单与映射一致性的合规面见 <a href=\"customs-consolidated\">合单清关申报处理</a>；拆单操作本身见 <a href=\"../merge-conflict/merge-unmerge-safe\">合单后取消/退货拆单</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"母包子包裹映射追踪","id":"母包子包裹映射追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪事件的上卷与下发","id":"追踪事件的上卷与下发"},{"level":3,"text":"事件时间与观测时间的分离","id":"事件时间与观测时间的分离"},{"level":2,"text":"拆单与再合包：映射的时间语义","id":"拆单与再合包-映射的时间语义"},{"level":2,"text":"映射的可观测性与数据质量","id":"映射的可观测性与数据质量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"部分到货先发 vs 等齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-conflict/partial-ship-decision"},"next":{"title":"集运各阶段状态（集货/合包/发出）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/consolidation-tracking/consolidation-status"}}